// The test tree's project, which an editor and vitest's transform both find by
// name. It extends `../tsconfig.e2e.json` rather than a `tsconfig.test.json`,
// because these tests run in Node, under Playwright or vitest, and need the
// `node` types the worker and page projects deliberately drop. Without this
// file the TS server infers a project that loads every `@types` package and
// reports `TS2403` clashes between `@types/mocha` and `@types/jest`.
//
// `include` is declared, not inherited: the transform applies a config only to
// files its own `include` lists, and gives any other file none of its options.
{
  "extends": "../tsconfig.e2e.json",
  "include": ["."]
}
